  Prefab: {fileID: 6625514644646704096, guid: 1f6a6789373206e498f996cb54aeedb1, type: 3}
  TextFields:
  - From Aunt Martha (Day 4)
  - "I\u2019m sorry about my last letter. I know how much you care about Elijah.
    Even if I don\u2019t understand it.  \r\n \r\nYour dad might act like this apology
    is all thanks to him. I admit, he did send me a strongly worded letter. But it\u2019s
    not just that. Our town saw an aurora last night. I tried to keep everyone calm,
    but no one knew what was happening. The whole town panicked. A few people were
    hurt. And I thought of you. What if something happened, and the last thing I
    said was to tear you down?\r\n \r\nYou\u2019ll always have a home here, whenever
    you\u2019re ready to come back. (And don\u2019t worry if you can\u2019t get the
    Z-pack . . .  though I wouldn\u2019t say no to some aspirin and normal saline.)\r\n"
  - "With love, \r\nAunt Martha\r"
  StreamingVisuals: []
  DefaultPinnedPos: {x: 1, y: 1, z: 0}
  ZoomOffsetOverride: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
